WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.753
To all citizens of the dominion,

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.424
on this eve of my last birthday 
as your queen,

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:10.802
let us have one last 
festivity together.

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:12.387
Let's party.

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:16.558
&lt;i&gt;Vampire Academy&lt;/i&gt; is about 
the friendship

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:19.019
between two young women, 
Rose and Lissa.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.062
As they enter the adult world, 
they realize 

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:24.065
the differences between them 
in class might be the thing 

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:26.276
that either tears them apart 
or makes them 

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.485
change the world together.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.529
Have you ever met a 
royal Moroi, 

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.991
in a high position of power, with a Dhampir best friend?

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:35.994
In this dominion, there are 
three distinct classes.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.247
The Moroi, a benevolent, 
mortal vampire.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:42.375
The Dhampir are raised to serve the Moroi 

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.084
as Guardians.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.545
They protect them against 
the Strigoi.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.798
Immortal, blood-thirsty vampires.

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:51.968
Rose Hathaway is a Dhampir.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:53.720
She wants to be the best guardian.

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:56.598
Yet she questions, 
"Why am I doing this?"

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:58.850
I want to protect my 
best friend,

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:01.019
and I want a life to call my own.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:04.355
Lissa Dragomir is a royal 
Moroi vampire.

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:06.232
She starts off the story 
really naive.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.401
Her life kind of gets flipped 
upside down.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:13.740
For the next heir to the throne, 
I name Vasilissa Dragomir.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:16.534
It's all very juicy and 
very dramatic.

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:18.036
I like young love.

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:19.704
I like love triangles.

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:21.790
I like the star-crossed lovers.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.750
There's Lissa and Christian.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:25.293
He's a royal Moroi.

00:01:25.293 --> 00:01:27.879
Unfortunately, he is 
an outcast.

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:29.881
I heard you spend a lot 
of time here.

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:31.382
Books don't gossip about me.

00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:33.134
They sort of have this spark.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.970
There's a real love there and 
a real genuine connection.

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:37.180
We shouldn't do this.

00:01:38.556 --> 00:01:39.265
Absolutely not.

00:01:40.391 --> 00:01:42.435
I like the love that was 
not meant to be.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.437
I like the love that 
tears us apart.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:47.482
And Rose and Dimitri 
embody all of that.

00:01:47.982 --> 00:01:50.485
Dimitri is an expert guardian.

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:52.654
Their chemistry is real.

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:54.114
You need this fight, Rose.

00:01:54.405 --> 00:01:55.532
I know you're hurting 

00:01:55.532 --> 00:01:57.408
and I'd do anything 
to make it stop.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:00.245
One of the great things about 
this show is that 

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:02.914
we have all these 
amazing fights.

00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:05.917
The stunt team created 
something beautiful.

00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:06.751
It's like a dance.

00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:08.336
You'll see a lot of 
precision and skill.

00:02:08.336 --> 00:02:09.963
They're everything I think everyone wants to see

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.256
when you're fighting vampires.

00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:12.340
It's pretty cool

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.175
getting to do all of the training 
and the fighting,

00:02:14.175 --> 00:02:16.845
and it's just nice to see 
black girls kicking ass, 

00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:18.596
and being brave and 
being beautiful.

00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:20.598
And I live for that. 
I live for that.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.976
We deserve a better future.

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:25.019
Moroi and Dhampir alike.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:26.980
&lt;i&gt;Vampire Academy&lt;/i&gt; has something 

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.983
very profound to say 
about equality.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.027
Gotten across in a fun and 
entertaining way.

00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:36.739
&lt;i&gt;Vampire Academy&lt;/i&gt; has love 
and romance.

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:38.992
It's got royal yumminess.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:41.286
It tells stories of loss and grief, 

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:43.955
but it is also the origin story 
of a revolution.

00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:46.166
If this is the way the world is, 

00:02:46.457 --> 00:02:49.294
then maybe it's the world that 
needs to change.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.755
And what a thrill to be able 
to tell that kind of story 

00:02:52.755 --> 00:02:54.966
with two young women 
at the center.

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:56.843
We are all apart of this dominion.

